  "bio": "Felipe Rodrigues is a renowned tattoo artist based in Sao Paulo, Brazil, boasting around 280k followers on Instagram. He is a master of neotraditional, trashpolka, and watercolor styles, and his dedication to his craft is easily seen through the stunning tattoos he creates. Keeping his creative spaces immaculately clean, Felipe ensures a safe and comfortable experience for all his clients. With the guiding principle, \"A vida é uma obra de arte em movimento,\" or \"Life is a work of art in motion,\" he infuses this belief into each unique piece of body art he produces.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location: Sao Paulo, Sao Paulo, Brazil"
